rule authority v1
description "Who decides an order, by its amount (fictional)"

enum decider = dept_head "Head of department" | president "President"

inputs
  amount : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=1_000JPY

outputs
  decider : decider

table authority
| amount   | -> decider |
| <=500JPY | dept_head  |
| >500JPY  | president  |

examples
| amount | -> decider |
| 1JPY   | dept_head  |
| 501JPY | president  |
